gif-rs
Copyright 2026 Chris Dobbyn

gif-rs is a new crate, not a port of one repository. Its LZW decoder and its record parser
follow giflib 5.2.1 step by step (see below); docs/design.md is the spec.

Third-party code and data
-------------------------

1. giflib 5.2.1, dgif_lib.c, gif_lib.h and gif_lib_private.h (MIT, Copyright (c) 1997 Eric S. Raymond).

   Ported or derived files: src/lzw.rs (the LZW decoder: DGifGetImageHeader (PixelCount setup),
   DGifSetupDecompress, DGifGetLine, DGifDecompressLine, DGifGetPrefixChar,
   DGifDecompressInput, DGifBufferedInput) and src/parse.rs (the record parser: DGifOpen,
   DGifGetScreenDesc, DGifGetRecordType, DGifGetImageDesc/DGifGetImageHeader, DGifGetExtension,
   DGifGetExtensionNext, DGifGetCodeNext). src/decoder.rs follows the checks and the call pattern
   of DGifSlurp but copies no giflib text.

   User of giflib (not a derived file): tests/parity/c/giforacle.c links giflib 5.2.1 as the
   parity oracle. It runs in CI only and is never linked into the crate.

